{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1504535-new-legacy-the-danse-diabolique","id":1504535,"title":"[New Legacy] The Danse Diabolique","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-03-05T22:08:28-08:00","id":1504535,"title":"[New Legacy] The Danse Diabolique","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><u><i><b>Inspirational Material:</b></i></u><br /> <i>Zorro</i></span></div> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><img data-align=\"center\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QB3oS46.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/QB3oS46.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/QB3oS46.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div> <div align=\"center\"><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>&quot;So you know that we're out there<br /> Swatting lies in the making<br /> Can't move fast without breaking<br /> Can't hold on or life won't change<br /> And our voices ring out, yeah<br /> Took the mask off to feel free<br /> Fought it out in the debris<br /> Now we know that life will change\u200b&quot;</i><br /> <b>-Life Will Change, Persona 5 OST</b></span></div> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Too much of Awakened society is predicated on the precepts of secrecy, of fearing the consequences of so-called Hubris, of rejecting the possibility of spreading the glorious self-affirmation made possible by Awakening. It is the duty and purpose of those who are free from the Lie to make it absolutely clear to the Sleepers that Truth is only found when staring death in the eyes and asking it for a dance. The world is full of danger, but that just means you have dancing partners to spare.<br /> <br /> No more spending nights reading grimoires about Atlantean Ruins that never lead anywhere.<br /> <br /> No more congregating in Sanctums hidden far from people who just need a spark of will.<br /> <br /> No more denying the undeniable, excusing the inexcusable, and repressing the irrepressible.<br /> <br /> Wear your mask, brandish your sword, and face the music.<br /> <br /> The world is your stage, and life is your Danse Diabolique!<br /> <br /> <i><u><b>Origins</b></u></i><br /> <br /> <b>Parentage:</b> Acanthus, Adamantine Arrow or Silver Ladder<br /> <br /> <b>Nicknames:</b> Choreographers<br /> <br /> <b>Background:</b> Romantics, bohemians, iconoclasts and other deviants who wish to confront their opponents and inspire their followers in an inspirational and theatrical manner.<br /> <br /> <b>Nimbus:</b> The sounds of dancing hooves, clashing blades and thundering applause.<br /> <br /> <u><b><i>Doctrine</i></b></u><br /> <br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Mind 2, Shadow Name 1, Two of the following Skills at 2 dots: [Expression/Subterfuge/Weaponry], a Specialty in one of these Skills (e.g. Dancing in Expression, Sword in Weaponry, Misdirection in Subterfuge)<br /> <br /> <b>Initiation:</b> The Mage must perform a significantly inspirational act of bravery when and where it is least expected, and also be wearing his magical persona linked to his Shadow Name Merit. Sabotaging organized crime, exposing governmental conspiracies, dismantling terrorist cells, deprogramming insane cults and preventing tragedies during protests are all valid examples, especially if the aspiring member manages to undermine the operations of the Seers Of The Throne. The only rules are:<br /> <br /> 1) No individuals who are uninvolved in the operations of the enemies can die or otherwise be irreversibly harmed as a direct result of the Mage\u2019s mundane or magical actions<br /> <br /> 2) There must be no usage of magic that results in Paradox or otherwise endangers the Fallen World. Usage of magic disguised as performances or activism is strongly encouraged.<br /> <br /> 3) The Mage must leave behind a calling card based on his magical persona linked to his Shadow Name Merit, thus signaling his willingness and readiness to embrace a life of danger to inspire Sleepers toward performing similar acts of bravery and thus grasping their chances to Awaken.<br /> <br /> <b>Organization:</b> Akin to an artistic commune with a degree of martial arts academy. Everyone is pretty individualistic, so the ranking system is based more on respect and mentorship than anything else. Members are ranked based on accomplishments as a crime-fighter, both for panache and for effectiveness, but mainly the latter. The consensus is that members can always add style during a future mission, but to really demonstrate the power of the Legacy\u2019s ideology, the completion of a mission must have increased the amount of bravery in the Fallen World, rather than merely being yet another Greek tragedy.<br /> <br /> <b>Theory:</b> If magic is a process of learning how to transform vision into reality, and learning works best when one has examples of how to do something, then the best way to teach the Art of the Mysteries is to demonstrate beyond all doubt that freedom from the Lie is not only possible, but eminently achievable to anyone who is willing and ready to make sacrifices and face dangers. As such, the symbol of the Legacy is dancing because the Legates invite Sleepers to a metaphorical dance in the sense of stepping out of their comfort zones to become part of something bigger than themselves.<br /> <br /> <u><i><b>Magic</b></i></u><br /> <br /> <b>Ruling Arcanum:</b> Mind<br /> <br /> <b>Optional Arcanum:</b> Fate<br /> <br /> <b>Yantras:</b> Custom fashion, music and melee weapons (+1, or +2 if they are especially resonant for the Mage\u2019s Shadow Name Merit), injuries and rivalries earned while confronting opponents or inspiring followers (+1, or +2 if associated with a negative Condition/Tilt), succeeding on an [Expression/Subterfuge/Weaponry] roll relevant to the spell (+2), symbols of recognition and admiration granted by opponents you've confronted or followers you\u2019ve inspired (+2)<br /> <br /> <b>Oblations:</b> Dancing and singing in a dangerous or theatrical manner, fooling someone into making an embarrassing mistake or admitting a secret, exchanging banter and speeches with opponents and followers<br /> <br /> <u><i><b>Attainments</b></i></u><br /> <br /> <b>1st: Reading The Crowds</b><br /> <b>Prerequisite: </b>Initiation<br /> Mental Scan. Reaching = Instant Casting. Restricted to asking questions about repressed thoughts related to freedom or danger. +1 Potency or Duration if the Mage uses a Tool Yantra related to freedom or danger, such as a badge of a sociopolitical movement or a newspaper depicting recent criminal operations.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional:</b> Fate<br /> Serendipity. Reaching = Instant Casting. Restricted to goals related to confronting enemies and inspiring followers. +1 Potency or Duration if the Mage uses a Tool Yantra related to tactics and strategy, such as devices of observation and communication.<br /> <br /> <b>2nd: Wearing The Mask</b><br /> <b>Prerequisite:</b> Mind 2, one of the Initiation Skills 3<br /> Alter Mental Pattern. Ritual, Reaching = Advanced Duration. Restricted to protecting thoughts that would reveal your connections between your Sympathetic Name and Shadow Name. +1 Potency or Duration if the Mage uses a Place Yantra related to performances and activism, such as theaters and city halls.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional: Fate 2</b><br /> Warding Gesture. Ritual, Reaching = Advanced Duration. Restricted to protecting against compulsions to expose your connections between your Sympathetic Name and Shadow Name. +1 Potency or Duration if the Mage uses a Place Yantra related to duty or devotion, such as centers for media outlets and martial training.<br /> <br /> <b>3rd: Parting The Curtains</b><br /> <b>Prerequisite:</b> Mind 3, both of the Initiation Skills 3<br /> First Impressions. Reaching = Instant Casting, Advanced Duration. Restricted to social interactions for confronting enemies or inspiring followers. +1 Potency or Duration if the Mage uses a Sacrament Yantra in the form of an object that represents an idea in favor of the enemies or in opposition of the followers.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional:</b> Fate 3<br /> Unseen Hands. Reaching = Instant Casting, Advanced Duration. Restricted to hiding subtle actions performed to confront enemies or inspire followers. +1 Potency or Duration if the Mage uses a Sacrament Yantra in the form of an object that helps the enemies or hinders the followers.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Unseen Hands (Fate \u2022\u2022)</b></u><br /> Practice: Veiling<br /> Primary Factor: Duration<br /> Withstood: Composure<br /> Suggested Rote Skills: Stealth, Subterfuge, Persuasion<br /> For the Duration of the spell, any actions the Mage takes which could be considered strange or invasive are considered routine parts of everyone's lives. Others will not find evidence to the contrary via mundane means unless they are specifically looking for the Mage, and supernatural means of investigation trigger a Clash Of Wills.<br /> <br /> +1 Reach, 1 Mana: The Mage redirects any possible suspicion toward false leads and scapegoats. If someone manages to suspect that something is not right about the Mage's actions, they suffer the Misinformed Condition on a number of rolls equal to [Potency] to find evidence for it.<br /> <br /> <b>Misinformed</b><br /> Effect: You've gathered or been given extensive but misleading information. When making a roll for the relevant topic, you may Resolve this Condition to gain a Beat. Your result is downgraded by one step (Exceptional Success =&gt; Baseline Success =&gt; Baseline Failure =&gt; Dramatic Failure). Should you get a Dramatic Failure, you receive another Beat.<br /> <br /> <b>4th: Inviting The Audience</b><br /> <b>Prerequisite:</b> Mind 4, one of the Initiation Skills 3 and the other Initiation Skill 4<br /> Impostor. Reach = Instant Casting, Advanced Duration. Restricted to impersonating members of enemy organizations or follower communities. +1 Potency or Duration if the Mage uses an Action Yantra consisting of switching places with a defeated enemy or protected follower.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional:</b> Fate 4<br /> Shifting The Odds. Reach = Instant Casting, Advanced Duration, Meeting The Advantage In 1 Hour Or Less. Restricted to finding advantages for sabotaging enemies or protecting followers. +1 Potency or Duration if the Mage uses an Action Yantra consisting of declaring intent to execute tactics and strategies but without fully revealing their details in advance.<br /> <br /> <b>5th: Giving The Spectacle</b><br /> <b>Prerequisite:</b> Mind 5, both of the Initiation Skills 4<br /> Allegory. Ritual, Reach = Advanced Duration, Upgrading Resonant Condition Into Open Condition. Restricted to affecting Goetia or equivalent Astral entity that symbolically resonates with the Mage's Shadow Name Merit. +1 Potency or Duration if the Mage has a Persistent Arcane Condition as a result of making a Pact with said Goetia or equivalent Astral entity, as described in Summoners supplement for Mage 1ed.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional:</b> Fate 5<br /> Shared Fate. Ritual, Reach = Advanced Duration, One-Way Transferal, Changing The Nature Of The Transferred Effect. Restricted to either transferring harm suffered by followers to the Mage, or transferring harm suffered by the Mage to the Goetia or equivalent Astral entity affected by the Attainment based on Allegory. +1 Potency or Duration if the Mage has sworn an Oath to defeat an enemy or save a follower in this scene<br /> .<br /> <u><b>Allegory (Mind \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)</b></u><br /> Practice: Patterning<br /> Primary Factor: Duration<br /> Suggested Rote Skills: Academics, Expression, Occult<br /> Withstand: Rank<br /> The Mage targets a Goetia or another Astral entity and transforms its Pattern into a manifested narrative logic. For the Duration of the spell, the target maintains its traits but gains the Living Story Manifestation (see below).<br /> <br /> +1 Reach: Phenomena which are Resonant for the entity are considered Open.<br /> <br /> <b>Living Story (Requires Open Condition)</b><br /> The goetia exists as an allegory for itself; rather than embodying an emotion or idea directly, the entity &quot;tells the tale&quot; of that concept, acting in an accordance with how it might metaphorically manifest in a story. In this form, the Goetia has all of its usual traits, but is compelled to &quot;tell&quot; the story of its allegory, acting out some aphorism or teaching a lesson about the concept it represents.<br /> <br /> To further this goal, it may spend 5 Essence to suffuse the area around it with the energy of its tale. Everyone in the vicinity is assigned a role that best befits them (whose actions would not inflict a breaking point on them), and acts out their role unless they spend a point of Willpower to shake the influence for a scene. Those so-affected, however, become slightly ephemeral themselves, gaining 1 Numen or 1 dot of Influence for each dot of the Goetia's Rank, and may spend Willpower as if it was Essence to fuel them.<br /> <br /> <u><b>New Traits</b></u><br /> <br /> <b>Pantheon Identity (Persistent, Arcane)</b><br /> Unlike most mages, who took on one Shadow Name (or several ones, but clearly different), this mage tried to take on the role of a whole pantheon at once. Usually this means he tries to live up to many ideals and aspirations at once, juggling them in the process. This gives a lot of power, but for a price. In this case, unlike many other ones, price is paid in having to be exemplar in his thoughts and deeds.<br /> <br /> This Condition allows Mage to have multiple Shadow Name Merits for the cost of one. Each additional Shadow Name requires a Dedicated Vow as described in Tome Of The Watchtowers, linked to the chosen Shadow Name in question. Breaking Dedicated Vow does not make the character lose this Condition, but denies him usage of linked Shadow Name, until he reestablishes his vow again (which should be possible in relatively short order for a suitable narrative price). He cannot receive Mana from any of those Vows.<br /> <br /> Beat: You suffer a significant setback due to these Dedicated Vows conflicting with each other.<br /> <br /> Resolution: The Mage willingly and knowingly limits himself to only one Shadow Name for an entire Chapter.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 03-06-2023, 05:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T10:00:09-08:00","id":1504601,"title":"","content":"&quot;Let our performance astonish the audience, that they too may be compelled to the dance floor of Arcadia&quot;<br /> <br /> A wonderfully thematic Legacy, just careful enough that it won't make the Guardians narrow their eyes, but with enough bravado that it rattles the bars of the Soul Cage with the sound of castanets, compelling Sleepers into action with its rhythm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}